{
	"info": {
		"_postman_id": "payment-api-v5-collection",
		"name": "Payment API - Mercado Pago Sandbox",
		"description": "Collection para a Payment API do sistema Delivery com integração Mercado Pago Sandbox.\n\n**Base URL:** http://localhost:8082/api/v1\n**Auth:** Bearer JWT (userId extraído automaticamente do token)\n\n## Credenciais necessárias:\n- `jwt_token` = seu token JWT Bearer (gerado pelo user-api)\n- `card_token` = CardToken gerado via MercadoPago.js ou API de card_tokens (sandbox)\n\n## Fluxos de pagamento:\n- **PIX**: POST /payments → MP Sandbox → retorna QR Code (status PENDING)\n- **Cartão**: POST /payments com gatewayToken → MP Sandbox direto → retorna COMPLETED/FAILED\n- **Cartão (sem token)**: POST /payments sem gatewayToken → apenas PENDING local\n- **Reprocessar**: POST /{id}/process → fallback para reenviar ao MP",

		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
	},
	"item": [
		{
			"name": "1. PIX",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "Criar Pagamento PIX",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"pm.test(\"Status 201 Created\", function () {",
									"    pm.response.to.have.status(201);",
									"});",
									"",
									"pm.test(\"Response contém QR Code e mpPaymentId\", function () {",
									"    var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
									"    pm.expect(jsonData.id).to.not.be.null;",
									"    pm.expect(jsonData.status).to.eql(\"PENDING\");",
									"    pm.expect(jsonData.qrCode).to.not.be.null;",
									"    pm.expect(jsonData.mpPaymentId).to.not.be.null;",
									"    pm.collectionVariables.set(\"payment_id\", jsonData.id);",
									"    pm.collectionVariables.set(\"mp_payment_id\", jsonData.mpPaymentId);",
									"});"
								],
								"type": "text/javascript"
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
							{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{jwt_token}}" }
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"orderId\": \"660e8400-e29b-41d4-a716-446655440002\",\n  \"amount\": 150.00,\n  \"paymentMethod\": \"PIX\",\n  \"payerEmail\": \"test_user_123@testuser.com\",\n  \"payerDocumentType\": \"CPF\",\n  \"payerDocumentNumber\": \"19119119100\"\n}"
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/payments",
							"host": ["{{base_url}}"],
							"path": ["api", "v1", "payments"]
						},
						"description": "Cria um pagamento PIX via Mercado Pago Sandbox.\n\nO userId é extraído automaticamente do token JWT (campo id ou sub).\n\n**paymentMethod=PIX** chama a API do Mercado Pago e retorna:\n- qrCode: código PIX copia-e-cola\n- qrCodeBase64: imagem do QR Code\n- ticketUrl: link para página de pagamento\n- mpPaymentId: ID do pagamento no Mercado Pago\n\n## Campos obrigatórios:\n- orderId, amount, paymentMethod\n\n## Campos recomendados:\n- payerEmail: email do comprador\n- payerDocumentType: CPF ou CNPJ\n- payerDocumentNumber: número do documento\n\namount: deve ser > 0\n\n**Requer MERCADOPAGO_ACCESS_TOKEN configurado.**"
					},
					"response": []
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"name": "2. Cartão de Crédito/Débito",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "Criar Pagamento Cartão (MP direto)",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"pm.test(\"Status 201 Created\", function () {",
									"    pm.response.to.have.status(201);",
									"});",
									"",
									"var json = pm.response.json();",
									"pm.collectionVariables.set(\"payment_id\", json.id);",
									"",
									"pm.test(\"Pagamento processado no MP\", function () {",
									"    pm.expect(json.status).to.be.oneOf([\"COMPLETED\", \"FAILED\", \"PENDING\"]);",
									"    if (json.status === \"COMPLETED\") {",
									"        pm.expect(json.gatewayTransactionId).to.not.be.null;",
									"        pm.collectionVariables.set(\"gateway_transaction_id\", json.gatewayTransactionId);",
									"    }",
									"});"
								],
								"type": "text/javascript"
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
							{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{jwt_token}}" }
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"orderId\": \"660e8400-e29b-41d4-a716-446655440100\",\n  \"amount\": 89.90,\n  \"paymentMethod\": \"CREDIT_CARD\",\n  \"payerEmail\": \"cliente@email.com\",\n  \"payerDocumentType\": \"CPF\",\n  \"payerDocumentNumber\": \"19119119100\",\n  \"gatewayToken\": \"{{card_token}}\",\n  \"paymentMethodId\": \"master\",\n  \"installments\": 1,\n  \"description\": \"Pedido de teste\"\n}"
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/payments",
							"host": ["{{base_url}}"],
							"path": ["api", "v1", "payments"]
						},
						"description": "Cria e processa pagamento com cartão via Mercado Pago Sandbox em uma única chamada.\n\nO userId é extraído automaticamente do token JWT.\n\n## Campos obrigatórios para cartão:\n- **gatewayToken**: CardToken gerado pelo MercadoPago.js ou API /v1/card_tokens\n- **paymentMethodId**: bandeira do cartão (visa, master, elo, amex, etc.)\n- **payerEmail**: email do comprador\n- **installments**: número de parcelas (default 1)\n\n## Campos recomendados:\n- **payerDocumentType**: CPF ou CNPJ\n- **payerDocumentNumber**: número do documento\n- **description**: descrição do pedido\n\n## Cartões de teste (sandbox):\n- Mastercard APRO: 5031433215406351 (sempre aprova)\n- Visa APRO: 4235647728025682 (sempre aprova)\n- Visa REJEITADO: 4002763673272116 (fundos insuficientes)\n\n## Status de resposta:\n- COMPLETED: pagamento aprovado\n- FAILED: pagamento rejeitado\n- PENDING: aguardando processamento\n\n**Requer MERCADOPAGO_ACCESS_TOKEN configurado.**"
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "Criar Pagamento Cartão (sem token - PENDING local)",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"pm.test(\"Status 201 Created\", function () {",
									"    pm.response.to.have.status(201);",
									"});",
									"pm.test(\"Status PENDING (não processado no MP)\", function () {",
									"    var json = pm.response.json();",
									"    pm.expect(json.status).to.eql(\"PENDING\");",
									"    pm.expect(json.gatewayTransactionId).to.be.null;",
									"    pm.collectionVariables.set(\"payment_id_pending\", json.id);",
									"});"
								],
								"type": "text/javascript"
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
							{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{jwt_token}}" }
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"orderId\": \"660e8400-e29b-41d4-a716-446655440101\",\n  \"amount\": 50.00,\n  \"paymentMethod\": \"DEBIT_CARD\"\n}"
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/payments",
							"host": ["{{base_url}}"],
							"path": ["api", "v1", "payments"]
						},
						"description": "Cria pagamento com cartão (sem gatewayToken).\n\n**NÃO chama o Mercado Pago** — apenas cria o registro PENDING local.\n\nUse o endpoint \"Reprocessar Pagamento\" para enviar ao MP posteriormente com o CardToken."
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "Reprocessar Pagamento (fallback)",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "prerequest",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"if (!pm.collectionVariables.get(\"payment_id_pending\")) {",
									"    pm.collectionVariables.set(\"payment_id_pending\", pm.collectionVariables.get(\"payment_id\"));",
									"}"
								],
								"type": "text/javascript"
							}
						},
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"pm.test(\"Status 200 OK\", function () {",
									"    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
									"});",
									"",
									"var json = pm.response.json();",
									"pm.test(\"Retorna status do pagamento\", function () {",
									"    pm.expect(json.status).to.be.oneOf([\"COMPLETED\", \"FAILED\", \"PENDING\"]);",
									"});"
								],
								"type": "text/javascript"
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
							{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{jwt_token}}" }
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"gatewayToken\": \"{{card_token}}\",\n  \"payerEmail\": \"cliente@email.com\",\n  \"installments\": 1,\n  \"paymentMethodId\": \"master\",\n  \"identificationType\": \"CPF\",\n  \"identificationNumber\": \"19119119100\",\n  \"description\": \"Reprocessamento do pedido\"\n}"
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/payments/{{payment_id_pending}}/process",
							"host": ["{{base_url}}"],
							"path": ["api", "v1", "payments", "{{payment_id_pending}}", "process"]
						},
						"description": "Reprocessa/envia um pagamento PENDING para o Mercado Pago Sandbox.\n\nUsado como fallback quando o pagamento foi criado sem CardToken.\n\n**gatewayToken** (obrigatório): CardToken gerado pelo MercadoPago.js ou API /v1/card_tokens.\n**payerEmail** (obrigatório): email do comprador.\n**paymentMethodId** (obrigatório): bandeira do cartão.\n**installments** (default 1): número de parcelas.\n\nStatus de resposta:\n- COMPLETED: pagamento aprovado\n- FAILED: pagamento rejeitado\n- PENDING: aguardando processamento\n\n**409 Conflict** se o pagamento já foi processado."
					},
					"response": []
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"name": "3. Consultas",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "Buscar Pagamento por ID",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "prerequest",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"if (!pm.collectionVariables.get(\"payment_id\")) {",
									"    pm.collectionVariables.set(\"payment_id\", \"770e8400-e29b-41d4-a716-446655440003\");",
									"}"
								],
								"type": "text/javascript"
							}
						},
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"pm.test(\"Status 200 OK\", function () {",
									"    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
									"});"
								],
								"type": "text/javascript"
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [
							{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{jwt_token}}" }
						],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/payments/{{payment_id}}",
							"host": ["{{base_url}}"],
							"path": ["api", "v1", "payments", "{{payment_id}}"]
						},
						"description": "Busca pagamento por ID.\n\nRetorna QR Code e dados do MP se for PIX.\nRetorna gatewayTransactionId e status se for cartão."
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "Listar Pagamentos do Usuário",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"pm.test(\"Status 200 OK\", function () {",
									"    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
									"});",
									"pm.test(\"Retorna array\", function () {",
									"    pm.expect(pm.response.json()).to.be.an('array');",
									"});"
								],
								"type": "text/javascript"
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [
							{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{jwt_token}}" }
						],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/payments?page=0&size=20",
							"host": ["{{base_url}}"],
							"path": ["api", "v1", "payments"],
							"query": [
								{ "key": "page", "value": "0" },
								{ "key": "size", "value": "20" }
							]
						},
						"description": "Lista todos os pagamentos do usuário autenticado.\n\n**O userId é extraído automaticamente do token JWT** — não precisa enviar como query param.\n\nParâmetros opcionais:\n- page: número da página (0-based, default 0)\n- size: itens por página (default 20, max 100)"
					},
					"response": []
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"name": "4. Reembolso",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "Reembolsar Pagamento",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "prerequest",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"if (!pm.collectionVariables.get(\"payment_id\")) {",
									"    pm.collectionVariables.set(\"payment_id\", \"770e8400-e29b-41d4-a716-446655440003\");",
									"}"
								],
								"type": "text/javascript"
							}
						},
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"pm.test(\"Status 200 OK\", function () {",
									"    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
									"});",
									"pm.test(\"Status REFUNDED\", function () {",
									"    pm.expect(pm.response.json().status).to.eql(\"REFUNDED\");",
									"});"
								],
								"type": "text/javascript"
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
							{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{jwt_token}}" }
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"paymentId\": \"{{payment_id}}\"\n}"
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/payments/refund",
							"host": ["{{base_url}}"],
							"path": ["api", "v1", "payments", "refund"]
						},
						"description": "Reembolsa um pagamento concluído (COMPLETED) tanto no nosso sistema quanto no Mercado Pago.\n\n**409 Conflict** se o pagamento já foi reembolsado ou não está COMPLETED."
					},
					"response": []
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"name": "5. Webhooks",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "Simular Webhook MP (pagamento aprovado)",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"pm.test(\"Status 200 OK\", function () {",
									"    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
									"});"
								],
								"type": "text/javascript"
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
							{ "key": "x-signature", "value": "ts=1700000000,v1=assinatura-simulada", "description": "Assinatura HMAC-SHA256 (validada se webhook-secret configurado)" },
							{ "key": "x-request-id", "value": "req-{{$guid}}", "description": "ID único da requisição" }
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"action\": \"payment.updated\",\n  \"data\": { \"id\": \"{{mp_payment_id}}\" },\n  \"type\": \"payment\"\n}"
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/payments/webhook",
							"host": ["{{base_url}}"],
							"path": ["api", "v1", "payments", "webhook"]
						},
						"description": "Simula uma notificação de webhook do Mercado Pago.\n\nHeaders:\n- x-signature: assinatura HMAC-SHA256 (validada apenas se webhook-secret estiver configurado)\n- x-request-id: ID único da requisição\n\nImportante: O data.id deve corresponder ao mpPaymentId de um pagamento existente no banco.\nUse {{mp_payment_id}} (preenchido automaticamente ao criar um PIX).\n\nEste endpoint é público (não requer JWT)."
					},
					"response": []
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"name": "6. Health",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "Health Check",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"pm.test(\"Status 200 OK\", function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });",
									"pm.test(\"Status UP\", function () {",
									"    pm.expect(pm.response.json().status).to.eql(\"UP\");",
									"});"
								],
								"type": "text/javascript"
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/actuator/health",
							"host": ["{{base_url}}"],
							"path": ["actuator", "health"]
						},
						"description": "Health check público (não requer JWT)."
					},
					"response": []
				}
			]
		}
	],
	"variable": [
		{
			"key": "base_url",
			"value": "http://localhost:8082",
			"type": "string"
		},
		{
			"key": "jwt_token",
			"value": "seu-jwt-token-aqui",
			"type": "string"
		},
		{
			"key": "payment_id",
			"value": "",
			"type": "string"
		},
		{
			"key": "payment_id_pending",
			"value": "",
			"type": "string"
		},
		{
			"key": "mp_payment_id",
			"value": "",
			"type": "string"
		},
		{
			"key": "card_token",
			"value": "8cdd0070406330b83da710c3dcf5c816",
			"type": "string"
		},
		{
			"key": "gateway_transaction_id",
			"value": "",
			"type": "string"
		}
	]
}
